  "body": "Opportunities of this scale on Milford Beach are increasingly difficult to find. Offering an exceptionally wide beachfront frontage and almost a quarter acre of land with direct beach access, this substantial family home occupies one of Milford’s most tightly held coastal positions.\r\n\r\nDesigned to make the most of its spectacular setting, the home offers generous proportions, excellent separation and a superb connection to both the beach and sheltered outdoor living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are four generous double bedrooms, each enjoying sea views, particularly the front two bedrooms. The impressive master suite includes an ensuite and opens directly to an expansive deck overlooking the beachfront. The remaining bedrooms are serviced by a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is dedicated primarily to living and entertaining. A substantial kitchen and formal dining area connect seamlessly with the main lounge, creating a relaxed and highly functional space for family living and entertaining. The entire area is oriented north towards the water, opening across an expansive lawn to the beach beyond.\r\n\r\nImportantly, the home also offers something often missing from beachfront property — a private and sheltered north-western courtyard away from the water. Complete with an excellent BBQ area and generous outdoor living, this provides a superb alternative entertaining space when coastal conditions turn, allowing the home to be enjoyed outdoors throughout the year.\r\n\r\nAt the rear is a substantial second lounge, media or games room, providing valuable separation for families. With a full bathroom immediately alongside, this area also offers excellent future flexibility and could potentially become a ground-floor bedroom suite, guest accommodation or home office. Further features include triple garaging, ducted heating and air conditioning throughout, and a recently repainted exterior and interior.",
